'==============================================================================
' MAU_SYS_SAT_RESET
'
' Responsibilities (per SoO):
' - Compute SAT reset setpoint as a linear function of the associated space
'   sensible cooling valve aggregate position (0-100%).
'
' Reset definition:
'   SmartSenseValvePos = 0%   -> SAT_RESET_SP = SAT_RESET_MAX_SP
'   SmartSenseValvePos = 100% -> SAT_RESET_SP = SAT_RESET_MIN_SP
'
' Notes:
' - Clamps SmartSenseValvePos to 0..100.
' - No assumptions are made about how aggregation is computed; that is external.
'==============================================================================

'-----------------------------
' INPUTS (Bindings)
'-----------------------------
NUMERIC INPUT SmartSenseValvePos

NUMERIC INPUT SAT_RESET_MAX_SP
NUMERIC INPUT SAT_RESET_MIN_SP

'-----------------------------
' OUTPUTS (Bindings)
'-----------------------------
NUMERIC OUTPUT SAT_RESET_SP

'-----------------------------
' INTERNAL VARIABLES
'-----------------------------
NUMERIC ValvePct_Clamped

'==============================================================================
INIT:
'==============================================================================

SAT_RESET_SP = SAT_RESET_MAX_SP
ValvePct_Clamped = 0

Goto MAIN


'==============================================================================
MAIN:
'==============================================================================

ValvePct_Clamped = SmartSenseValvePos

If ValvePct_Clamped < 0 then ValvePct_Clamped = 0
If ValvePct_Clamped > 100 then ValvePct_Clamped = 100

' Linear interpolation:
' SAT_RESET_SP = MAX + (MIN - MAX) * (Pct/100)
SAT_RESET_SP = SAT_RESET_MAX_SP + (SAT_RESET_MIN_SP - SAT_RESET_MAX_SP) * (ValvePct_Clamped / 100)

Wait 1
Goto MAIN
